---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { breadcrumbList } from '../data/site';
const breadcrumbSchema = breadcrumbList([{name:'Home',url:'/'},{name:'About',url:'/about'}], Astro.site);
---
<BaseLayout title="About EFU" description="Learn about EFU Goods Traders and its technology, infrastructure and international supply operations across Kuwait, UAE and India." structuredData={[breadcrumbSchema]}><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</div><span class="eyebrow">ABOUT EFU</span><h1>Technology expertise with international supply capability.</h1><p>EFU Goods Traders supports customers across Kuwait, the UAE and India through technology infrastructure, product supply and international trading services.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container content-grid"><article class="prose"><span class="eyebrow">OUR APPROACH</span><h2>Practical solutions. Clear project delivery.</h2><p>EFU brings technology services and product sourcing together under one organisation. The technology division focuses on connectivity, cabling, surveillance, communication and support, while the trading division serves wider commercial sourcing requirements.</p><h2>Two connected divisions</h2><ul class="feature-list"><li>Technology & Infrastructure</li><li>International Trading & Supply</li><li>Kuwait operations</li><li>UAE operations</li><li>India operations and sourcing</li><li>Multi-brand product options</li></ul><p>Further company history, registrations, certifications and office details should be added after formal client confirmation.</p></article><aside class="side-card"><span class="eyebrow">EFU PROMISE</span><h3>Quality with speed.</h3><p>A simple principle retained from the original EFU website and supported through organised project communication and delivery.</p><a class="btn" href="/contact#quote">Discuss a Project</a></aside></div></section></BaseLayout>
